{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1442,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3f6bd82d81885c382494226",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候，目白家的姐姐大人们身穿\r\n典雅泳装的模样是那么耀眼……\r\n儿时的梦想，终于实现了～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "45939770441c23c0689c3faf534e6f7116f276880a3bc4d4c73d295d10526499",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "91229"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323a87a136f0721c1a41ad3b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "享用完茶跟点心，\r\n这下准备万全了～\r\n我随时可以上场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "580cfe7e7626febe68e6dfce80825c7349758fcdb650a2da8700d26087a16029",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:351fc892dd10107a2fa249b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2548fb5f79fc734c38892900db400818e25ed3bb406f4854ca05fc1e5e70330",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f76575c99ec9224fe13ba360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对了，训练员要不要\r\n也一起奔跑呢？\r\n草地跑起来很舒服喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed8ece48521a87ec0754e7d5b50823fa285b4f343d8e19bacde41a6b34ed4f0d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16fb88d6366f43c6ae55ce6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我动作慢，\r\n但我会诚心地……\r\n专注进行每一项练习。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7202ea0bc6543c29af73c4c2e6926a834ea3068fe4093cb4be14c0da877c41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d5de0b3c0c85728214759bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请看着我的眼睛。\r\n……能看到那颗燃烧的心吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "47d6bcde963d75a27037e540603ee6a5a9044c066aa3672374d84bb5d58f9444",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0125ce9da42b9214ddc055f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感到疲倦时就好好休息吧～\r\n我会一直在这里等着你的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6284e1b14e126d227379a28b65585fc4313a3d4c501ec7e9b15a24272a21b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:745bba184c8162ca0d43260a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我们之间步调也很契合，已经可说是\r\n最佳默契拍檔了吧～\r\n默～契……默～契～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "582c2b1c3bfb38ae23c0542fc955a623ba1880e19753d053f1e2b9090d955f4e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93026a67a58ede455cdfdc70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "曾有人告诉我，感到冬天漫长时，\r\n就代表春天也快到了～\r\n我……真的很幸福呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c38cc2f1ac8cf90ec3fb98117d03d5a5d58befc063b29e7be01f19736df97f3f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cea80f742c021e97a468c85",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来吧，仔细倾听……\r\n听得见海浪声呢～\r\n呵呵呵，听起来好像摇篮曲～",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9756f7ceb3f14d9291b4eeca670c2641f35575869fd173edac3bcf9890ee239",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8107368ea626c8751e88983e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了把胜利当作礼物送出去。\r\n我会一步一个脚印，稳步成长。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85078b30c66d51e49397cc8b66e63aa36edb6bfcdafbc08acbf274da6ec17662",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:653de8efc2783bb6b914d03b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要能一直一直，跑得更久\r\n就能实现跑遍全世界的愿望\r\n呢。作为圣诞老人，我会努力的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c12d3697f05a2037b945f4324711298421624c175fa112b81ca26a45748c24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6659d245597a1863a1bbdff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会为大家送上\r\n令人目眩神迷的光辉。\r\n毕竟，我可是目白家的圣诞老人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b3c00681b16e95139b89a9cdd4e186002696ac3889b30de25f9b56f6d4a752d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2d5e02fb69ba2cb6624bd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目白家的圣诞派对上大家会\r\n通过大屏幕为『有马纪念』助威\r\n呢。场面非常震撼喔～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb4d43bfda49a4b0a7b0567e644bb045e759180ae96b9a83d3be7e6f292efd9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04735c5de7fcf53514bf4558",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员大人，您对这样的\r\n服装也有兴趣吗？\r\n如果穿同款一起奔跑应该很可爱～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "178b6033f1edc3694117307ab821f0e953ab84bfda4da36ea77308d60f598864",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d84a5bd3e87a6c89fb786fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小时候，我喜欢让人抱起来装饰\r\n圣诞树顶端的星星。\r\n在比赛中，也要点亮白色星星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "401e417377284fbc47f9b6ad5b0b143df68fd290dd584219f533ecfe0fc61584",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea04b7e47eb95e7e413ecb5c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于训练员大人，我想献上一场特别的\r\n胜利。\r\n即使准备要花很久，也一定会做到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb7f062705a8d955ca595c898c49f600d0030a760832e00f358d5e78de1259f3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01c3fb73481206db8855c37b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像这套泳装一样，优雅地\r\n前进吧～。我好歹也是\r\n目白家的赛马娘，当然要优雅。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a432673e6992eb0d65ec93d3c909f710ea0a8cd33e930ece3d01e9eee888d43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d021b6d9f0e03d78638ec4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一～～，二～～…呵呵，\r\n热身运动已经做得很充分～。\r\n那么，出发吧～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "260e28fe169848c121eb8f30bf1b6d8507ebc3533e3eb60ef0da5d133a0f28c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:089162c92d0f21ca25c225f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像堆沙堡一样…。\r\n训练也要慢慢来，\r\n谨慎地一点点积累～",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d02b85e547390082d3e7242fc9867ad531f433cc734a76e3a3f16e1c650bc42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:663b84381fc1b4fe3695d36d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每次看到训练用轮胎，\r\n就想去海上悠悠漂浮呢～。\r\n因为它看起来，就像游泳圈一样",
      "source_fingerprint": "930336ece7dec02db97f5f6efca9d7513fc80d8cc480403cd0642615167724a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fbe25b55128648e7afbf821",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果阳光太强，请告诉我\r\n一声。我带了足够两人用的阳伞\r\n呢，一起休息一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "731ccbdbce7131f0b303dc0266a32bc05f6d2faa3143f91c144f5a5de94d0af8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de43c1b8cd8d942e8044292",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多大的风浪都请交给我～。\r\n只要是训练员大人的指示，\r\n我一定会跨越过去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2332962de1f9e37b50959ef9d8228bd4dcc64a85584acb5cf3cbb439bb76acac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba00d358dfca1436d027354d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您愿意一直陪在我身边，眺望\r\n沉入海中的美丽夕阳…。正因为是这样的您\r\n我才想，与您携手同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08e9ba83a7ba2386fef1a31c3caf8666be75d19db99812e1ac7a46ab21f5f67b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fb488e495e2ae7a876e407d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请摸摸头称赞我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3cba014a404f88563994eb8601f8e27282a27cca964a1602b15d5ad8aba6decd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30ac7bbe2b4426491dc742df",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "平时受你诸多照顾了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8eb954c0070d973d8eb633b47507404d7f6cb2d974b395298348ac55a3df6341",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb66875599e6cf3b639b11bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于，我点亮了奇迹的光辉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f881e6090390b0d5ac85de5a4660b76cc3c8e118b3644e0193f5b4c35326ef14",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa5f7ac8dafc731555de52cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于，我把礼物送出去了～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83a1dea2e39d857ba1d0b2b67eab926f5ae6c6d3cf0e8ccec041927ef2f9e501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bea207714749e88416890f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使要去往大海彼岸，只要和您一起…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b70ad91c27415d9dd87ad6e96b7391c2d251e0968556b7b438de43bfde4dfef2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95f9aa52b0a12dfa9db6a37e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，慢～慢地抵达终点了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b6ef338afbd74b284e7e65df8824a8d84900417afb24ff27d4a0d552157c486",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f605683c0dc87a187d9681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "自～在～写～意～地一路成长～",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4d261218985462ff4c68aabd35daa442d385da9879c8451001f174e2d428b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9371057accc2f46538a87db5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是专属于我的武器呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "50aff5ed062f9b595c340ca88af207a80ece5624b5f1de831120da1c495572e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b22fa779d20674373241b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好呀～我是目白光明～",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f62aad8d6c6b818e746d87a208eb1d0286db02889a05d6e5ab962f4e5dcf349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e255b0473b5cbfc0b30d215f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我将为目白家带来……\r\n新的春天～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "738dac0cd192ca93d2e6acbf3080180db54ad416683054be450ee9d6ea8b8ce5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5efa31fcc394bd4e7db789c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是平日努力的成果～",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1219872bb4f57699928168397bee7ecac0483d313451f38fdae812b1cfe0f97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb166b3ff14b038c3fb3f207",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会响应这份期待的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f288d7c2e60a1959fd2356e0f47e4c9f09d24f27e583c7c448c05b7c011b63ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b5a8745a51927f0dc541843",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要成为强大的圣诞老人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d560bcbcb51555b63c31b31c8aef6995bb3656760da07c8451aa8a30be2507f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfbbfcc53648569ad7f105c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今以后，我会更加闪耀～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6652eb6d827148682913ee073f1329e9fc146f57bd2aef9560d1ff739585b5bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8da7c06dcdaffdddb2d40e62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "邀请您共度\r\n闪耀的圣诞节～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2327438242099e582716d122f7b4fc2c25e9622746547705f5fd1a7b8ffdf262",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4713e7420eaf48d5be7da7f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来～啦，我是目白光明圣诞老人～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e070ca9d74188766f373f987d0381a63eb20ca4067f322b7ce17bddd2dc6547",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cfd224a550991e080f34296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像夏日的太阳一样，闪闪发光呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69abb8090c40b1714d57ae883f9ad6f2a0377a267b38d78fd5c87bb52c527eac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27b59da0a7d9fa00051b7eb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来，我还能游得更远呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f8c63e9e36fb253c2f430f5fc7de785b5241835fc815a12b29d09e7faf52a02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71c24b1421a894b5da7c1e99",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不会忘记这个夏天。\r\n……即使今后尽是荣耀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab1cfdb4a7822c2a6d4c19ad49027992dd59a25726ba09dc1f73b72dc68db36c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2601d7e539d63a31a6562bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是目白光明。一起悠悠前进吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2f8db72b6c9517ac218f6d2afe71d6d3f28e3879bc58e1e7158ec8ad8a891cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1074",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5635c0995e3322b47a03ab0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "作为乱入参加的赔礼，送什么\r\n比较好呢？…送一颗大白菜的话，\r\n大概会给对方造成困扰吧…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f838a43fd227cdf2faaeb6e7ccb98f8f521916c2518b16b7bed1ed8eefa8796",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1075",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdaaae1f6e3cf49f89e649f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『相同』是我们之间的核心。\r\n所以胸针是成对的。\r\n…成对的，小鸟胸针。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e4b1ce38553b870e39e926c5fb1019020df2f56a0ce0432bcdeac2a6baee52d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1075",
        "400007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffaca40f871ded2f2a2b2f64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会继续披上…那与勇心前辈\r\n同色的，勇气与光辉。然后\r\n总有一天――要从草坪上献上祝福的花束。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea8b64bec19ac740e21191e132af78a303e40b3b2b7e84a752503860110948b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1075",
        "400014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502d846a9558b2656080804e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备OK！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b04c637281af4c4ae28629441a224cbd0e1ff354e787f2cd5db4b972cb7bee9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18cf55890ae4aa1667f3be42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信不管多远大的梦想，\r\n只要有你陪着我，\r\n就一定能实现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "402aa79f6f1dd8f9d67f4133887223fe325ae3377bdb55ea9f3a3f18a8268cf7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df55d4e663ef32483089672e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってきます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "793275eb5254d9ee0aa95daa33c90a973bec2e4a987e75c094e5b5d339927bef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b6fba9ae5c211ffbd577978",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま帰りました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "481ece6b5ae3f39ab09cef14164dcd64ddd6f960e487ca411576688b02f8f52f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dcc1287535b03b1b933cb2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之所以能够继续跑步，\r\n都是因为你一直向前迈进！\r\n因为你的双眼──总是闪闪发亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3677622ebd5f5ae5c389ba64ccc8729ec4158f24acbbea6a019e1e234c6d471a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1308a9f0db587ccbe9cc3380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "法国有着丰富的文化！\r\n所以我还有好多好多\r\n想跟你一起做的事情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8193b183d23efe42b2ca5e1717fa51a2a5a79b52718782abfee95bcdc59c7fb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c16341d9bb6e4b1655ef2f1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n全新的一年揭开序幕──\r\n换句话说，全新的梦想就此展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1a9f0a089727bf0a8e35cbbdeaec007f23f5d67e3e2f6055573bdb8b360a95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f6e3926bf98f4d68c19b5cc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "许多闪耀的心意\r\n彼此交会……呵呵，\r\n感觉会是幸福满溢的一天♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ecf5e0d38fd8f6697590e0e202cae0d92eca457dc027ff27dfd39d61d7ba0b89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fad93eb664502a1447683cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要和我将同一块巧克力\r\n对半分着吃呢？\r\n为了让我们能继续追寻同样的梦想！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae6f2bb381b8a25072da4016bcc4b075c8c478e90c0ede249e2028fdfca8beb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45fd0139e0b5b6d230c33ae3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "愿望没有任何限制！\r\n要不要贪心一点，\r\n试着描绘出许多梦想？",
      "source_fingerprint": "55e98b7a9b5ecf39de2118da98115281fca14b337e605b21b1bd81f54843b38f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:920db2d5609a0e348b1765ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "把跳跳糖混进零食里面──\r\n好了！不晓得进王跟小千\r\n会不会吓一大跳呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b280bc124296dcdf8e24a42b1fafb41252e08d8443be2e66e3b98632cc807f64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5281d86f07417df061c26be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去圣诞市集看看？\r\n从香料面包到奶油圆蛋糕，\r\n每一样我都能保证很美味♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca10a1dcdd2663f6f26fd8226ef0c9f97044eab19a6b8a951aa179c5259fac1e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db4f3f49058d2b3fc61fa4be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家的笑容就跟\r\n灯饰一样闪耀呢。\r\n看，你的脸也一样……呵呵♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c4005c46386389b658cde687f62be9157c0b8015584ba379f7427913d72261",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0512510463a6dcfdb873461e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "太好了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc4a4a75c655e69f5aa9602de71b3b3b441439d2887a36bbc821e42c3c4f4c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da77dd356c2bb5dc1c19cc0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年有没有还没完成的事呢？\r\n有的话就赶紧去做吧！\r\n没问题，现在还来得及！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a3073bb9b584545759619c5ad11cad1e43552b5da112434ee6bcb3511064359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:603f3205788125938d255273",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "祝你生日快乐♪\r\n我们今年也要一起创造\r\n许多能感受到幸福的瞬间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "25697c3327f9a62ce593caf3e2d8e9053a7cfb836ece3153d243404df24cd0ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f61a0188370eab8de9d5c93e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果有想做的事请跟我说！\r\n只要时间允许，\r\n我今天会奉陪到底！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae5dac52eddd46da6edf18bd6bfbdf8b15abc6873d1a4d5fd3e31bdb011f1777",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5deb6cedb0a37a61f7102bdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "菱菱跟宿舍的大家\r\n好像为我做了蛋糕。\r\n好期待能赶快吃到喔♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "33ab76280040fe0c1bf6408bd5977832882691e8eedc48a0bf996ebf9a59b64b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b7fb280c1a0540573a4d6dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我想去法国旅行！\r\n……只是说说而已。为了有一天真的\r\n能成行，我现在就先在这里发誓哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfd65e92eb1b28ec61e6ce46145ef517884f8bbcb8c8b19a1f3e6b91417d0b57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1fd68165dc11f56100442c70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有新的公告喔！\r\n走吧走吧，\r\n我们一起去看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b96b0f9e397f69e353bb30556bbf3da3a5f75824ddf9548116d748dc91c6b0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95defe14b4e578b5d4fa346e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到礼物了！\r\n要不要来猜猜看\r\n里面装了什么呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb3a1f8ff4108c8f98652156b7488926ef6c10e3144586368f1f35b59014706e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd84104393f1ea7191a1d060",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成任务！\r\n收下奖赏吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f88c91f049ac0ef6e60204b48ef521e83ec342ebe06b10d144853a66f0d8f502",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b60e530fde7be0f7c43fb195",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像要开始了！\r\n你做好心理准备了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e431c68f857bd2ab527a34da343080895a41a50a6d396cf7620d9135569e86a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d93b7c233d30198f4369589",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了！\r\n我们就好好玩吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "44905cf9d971c4e6f08145fb7a84a0a8087eb02dfffdc22d4cee5db673195b52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95cd12c6cdf01b01fc41b3b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转换一下心情吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c86ea0a9537648195b60e4484bad083102491e5b2be7d47db43b33986265306",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee441cff9217f3e55345c0f9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "3922d02a7cf0687c8076d2a4ed510bf9fa7457a80cff09c02feb19fbac99e5f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:981f9d44af49df16c2e9eef7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "落ち着くんです、サクラ色。\r\nずっと一緒に歩んできた\r\n色ですからっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "59addaa2a252a5af53894a700aa5214b6cd5cf26e7f1efce5f051c379bba6ccc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:398de779b16f1f63892f76de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "母とは服の好みが似ていて。\r\n気づけばペアルックみたい、\r\nなんてことがよくありました♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f36c3b7c70f11ac75a7529054a15221559bdd2d25fc1a32fd1d49ee19f53f4b8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50f4a74435a308a9397601c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1人で出かけるのも好きなんです！\r\n父の気ままな性格を\r\n受け継いでいるのかもしれません♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f2f0ea21bf831ba7f971dd9882c9a1e069ace4e81fcf204ae45759422a52d46",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43f5cc28584a7e74afdec890",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然是平手啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b091056fa8f5a3f13a981383147d1f860bd7580f3b827f250f2a42a8ce5d846b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9d272f69621b0e6ed37a1d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c328cf26a3fd5d995a83e439c1e6d7bf2c420c5f59add386c869518c1a236d8e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a3be82af274a5864ba645c62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "转换一下心情吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c86ea0a9537648195b60e4484bad083102491e5b2be7d47db43b33986265306",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afb2f78d55936252aae9183b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然是平手啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b091056fa8f5a3f13a981383147d1f860bd7580f3b827f250f2a42a8ce5d846b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1076",
        "1006"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
